      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>I'm sorry I have to ask this, I am just learning the game. I know this is likely an simple that I am overthinking buuuut, here goes....I&nbsp;am trying to set up SFLF and the card says; \" Put 3 Presence on your starting board. 2 in the highest numbered jungle and 1 in Land #5\"</p>\r\n\r\n<p>What and where is \"Land #5\" ?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Does it mean any&nbsp;space on the island with a #5 on it ?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Thanks in advance for your help</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
